      <rules>
        <rule id="911c-7bba-28ca-7094" name="Feat: Overkill" hidden="false">
          <description>After resolving each ranged attack that hits an enemy model, Caine gains a cumulative +1 to his spe]Jstorm Pistol damage rolls. When a model is boxed by a Spell storm Pistol attack, center a 3&quot; AOE on it and remove it from play. Models in the AOE are hit and suffer an unboostable POW 10 blast damage roll. Overkill expires at the end of Caine&apos;s activation.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="f7b6-3d7a-8fb7-23ea" name="Elite Cadre [Arcane Tempest]" hidden="false">
          <description>Friendly Arcane Tempest models gain Gunfighter.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
