      <rules>
        <rule id="4faa-6cb2-47d4-0008" name="Feat: Horsepower" hidden="false">
          <description>Friendly knocked down Faction warjacks currently in Kraye&apos;s control area that were not knocked down this tum immediately stand up. Friendly Faction warjacks currently in his control area can immediately turn to face any direction. Affected warjacks can charge without spending focus. Affected charging models gain +2&quot; movement. Melee attack rolls made by affected warjacks are boosted. Horsepower lasts for one tum.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <infoLinks>
