      <rules>
        <rule id="c9a0-b862-d961-cb99" name="Feat: Firing Squad" hidden="false">
          <description>While in Sloan&apos;s control area, friendly Faction models gain boosted ranged attack rolls. When a model in Sloan&apos;s battlegroup that is in her control area hits an enemy model with a normal ranged attack during its activation, immediately after that attack is resolved a model in Sloan&apos;s battlegroup that is in her control area can make one normal ranged attack. A model can make only one Firing Squad attack. Firing Squad lasts for one turn.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
