              <description>Warjacks: Cygnar non-character warjacks with ranged weapons, Lancers

Units: Arcane Tempest Gun Mages, Field Mechaniks, Long Gunner Infantry, Rangers

Solos: Journeyman Warcaster</description>
            </rule>
            <rule id="38d5-7e23-0ce4-8abd" name="Tier 1 Benefit" hidden="true">
