                  </conditions>
                </modifier>
              </modifiers>
              <description>Friendly models/units can begin the game affected by Stryker&apos;s upkeep spells. These spells and their targets must be declared before either player sets up models. Stryker does not pay focus to upkeep these spells during your first turn.</description>
