      </constraints>
      <rules>
        <rule id="488a-6874-7174-7b2e" name="Feat: Dead on Arrival" hidden="false">
          <description>Enemy non-warlock, non-warcaster models in Sturgis’ control area are pushed 3˝ directly toward Sturgis in the order you choose. Then enemy models within 3˝ of Sturgis suffer a POW 12 magical damage roll. For each model destroyed by Dead on Arrival, you can allocate 1 focus point to a warjack in Sturgis’ battlegroup in his control area.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="3762-f6d1-97c9-9324" name="Chain Attack: Flash" hidden="false">
          <description>If this model hits the same target with both its initial melee attacks, after resolving the attacks you can immediately place this model anywhere completely within 3˝ of its current location.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <infoLinks>
        <infoLink id="3de7-f803-98c7-74c7" hidden="false" targetId="99a911fe-2889-424f-a5d6-eb773dc70985" type="rule" name="Relentless Charge"/>
