      <rules>
        <rule id="424760f7-2b43-928f-9885-aafc77b4dc8c" name="Drive: Off Road" publicationId="3f7c-e510-pubN66105" page="120" hidden="false">
          <description>This model can attempt to drive each warjack under its control in its command range. To drive a warjack, this model must make a command check at any time during its activation. If it passes, the warjack gains Pathfinder and must use its normal movement and combat action to charge or make a slam power attack during its activation this turn. If it fails, the warjack does not benefit from &apos;Jack Marshal this turn.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="be5bdc94-22cc-5479-3fea-90bf638b2311" name="Repair[8] (* Action)" publicationId="3f7c-e510-pubN66105" page="120" hidden="false">
          <description>This model can attempt repairs on any damaged friendly Faction warjack. To attempt repairs, this model must be B2B with the damaged warjack and make a skill check. If successful, remove d6 damage points from the warjack&apos;s damage grid.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
