              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
          <rules>
            <rule id="9fb3-a4a8-5cf8-1f56" name="Back Blast" hidden="false">
              <description>When this model h its with an attack with this weapon, it can spend 1 focus point to use Back Blast. If it does, center a 3&quot; AOE on the model hit. Models in the AOE suffer a POW 10 blast damage roll. This damage is not considered to have been caused by a melee attack.</description>
            </rule>
          </rules>
