            <rule id="7fbe-f01d-cc33-a39d" name="The Weathermen Tier" hidden="false">
              <description>Warjacks: Cygnar non-character warjacks, Thunderhead

Units: Field Mechaniks, Stormguards, Stormsmith units

Solos: Journeyman Warcaster, Squire, Stormsmith solos</description>
            </rule>
            <rule id="c87a-84e5-2ffe-e44b" name="Tier 4 Benefit" hidden="true">
              <modifiers>
                <modifier type="set" field="hidden" value="false">
                  <conditions>
                    <condition field="selections" scope="dfcb-5366-6bfc-fc79" value="4" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" childId="f951-b8a4-18bc-980a" type="equalTo"/>
                  </conditions>
                </modifier>
              </modifiers>
              <description>Friendly models/units can begin the game aiffected by Nemo&apos;s upkeep spells. These spells and their targets must be declared before either player sets up models. Nemo does not pay focus to upkeep these spells during your first turn.</description>
            </rule>
          </rules>
