          <constraints>
            <constraint field="selections" scope="parent" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="false" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" id="maxSelections" type="max"/>
          </constraints>
          <rules>
            <rule id="dba9-71fa-9c1b-297e" name="Strands of Fate Tier" hidden="false">
              <description>Warjacks: Cygnar non-character warjacks, Thorn

Units: Field Mechaniks, Long Gunner Infantry, Trencher Units

Solos: Journeyman Warcaster, Trencher solos</description>
            </rule>
            <rule id="feb4-bcc7-c431-a579" name="Tier 1 Benefit" hidden="true">
              <modifiers>
                <modifier type="set" field="hidden" value="false">
                  <conditions>
                    <condition field="selections" scope="4fdc-52f8-19ec-a69f" value="1" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" childId="c635-9fda-436e-935d" type="atLeast"/>
                  </conditions>
                </modifier>
              </modifiers>
              <description>You can begin the game with Haley Past and/or Haley Future in play. For each model in this unit in play at the start of the game you can redeploy one model/unit after both players have deployed but before the first player’s first turn. The redeployed models must be placed on the table in a location they could have been deployed initially.</description>
            </rule>
            <rule id="057b-15dc-1415-eebb" name="Tier 3 Benefit" hidden="true">
              <modifiers>
                <modifier type="set" field="hidden" value="false">
                  <conditions>
                    <condition field="selections" scope="4fdc-52f8-19ec-a69f" value="3" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" childId="c635-9fda-436e-935d" type="atLeast"/>
                  </conditions>
                </modifier>
              </modifiers>
              <description>Units in the army gain Prowl during the first round of the game. (Models with Prowl gain Stealth while within terrain that provides concealment, the AOE of a spell that provides concealment, or the AOE of a cloud effect.)</description>
            </rule>
            <rule id="f99d-ddb1-4a98-6910" name="Tier 4 Benefit" hidden="true">
              <modifiers>
                <modifier type="set" field="hidden" value="false">
                  <conditions>
                    <condition field="selections" scope="4fdc-52f8-19ec-a69f" value="4" percentValue="false" shared="true" includeChildSelections="false" includeChildForces="false" childId="c635-9fda-436e-935d" type="equalTo"/>
                  </conditions>
                </modifier>
              </modifiers>
              <description>During your first turn of the game, models in Haley’s battlegroup gain +2 SPD.</description>
            </rule>
          </rules>
          <costs>
            <cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="0"/>
          </costs>
        </selectionEntry>
      </selectionEntries>
      <costs>
        <cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="-3"/>
      </costs>
    </selectionEntry>
