      <rules>
        <rule id="1c55e139-3e8a-5412-1996-310e0bfc0da4" name="Drive: Hog Wild" publicationId="3f7c-e510-pubN96742" page="108" hidden="false">
          <description>This model can attempt to Drive each warjack under its control in its command range. To Drive a warjack, thjis model must make a command check at any time during its activation. If it passes, the warjack can make one ranged attack this activation before its normal movement. After its normal movement, the warjack can only make melee attacks that activation. If it fails, the warjack does not benefit from &apos;Jack Marshal this turn.</description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="603d93f0-6c6f-7cd6-cb55-4204d24912a7" name="Repair[8] (* Action)" publicationId="3f7c-e510-pubN66105" page="120" hidden="false">
          <description>This model can attempt repairs on any damaged friendly Faction warjack. To attempt repairs, this model must be B2B with the damaged warjack and make a skill check. If successful, remove d6 damage points from the warjack&apos;s damage grid.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
