      <rules>
        <rule id="e788074a-0bb8-9959-518b-90b55508d2a4" name="Piper" hidden="false">
          <description>During its activation this model can play one of the following tunes. When it does, choose a friendly unit. The tunes affects this model and will affect the unit if it is currently in this model&apos;s command range.

- Dirge of Mists - affected models gain +1 DEF and Terror for one round.

- Heroic Call - Affected models gain Fearless and Tough for one round.

- March - Affected models gain Pathfinder for one turn.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
