        <rule id="f25c-0f8c-f3fc-7095" name="Ravager" hidden="false">
          <description>Target model in this model&apos;s battlegroup gains Berserk for one turn. While affected by Ravager, a model cannot make Chain Attacks. (When a model with Berserk destroys one or more models with a melee attacks during its combat action, immediately after the attacks is resolved it must make one additional melee attack against another model in its melee range.)</description>
